# Snapshot cache (per-machine; manifest is the source of truth)
platform/test-snapshots/

# Benchmark harness scratch — throwaway venv, generated dashboards, one-off
# analysis scripts. doc 39's snapshot store (nmemo-hm4.2 retention decision):
# history.jsonl + gold/ + per-run manifest.json/metrics.json/report.md are
# TRACKED (trend over commits, §3.3); the bulky regenerable per-run graph dumps
# (*.canonical.json / *.rich.json) are ignored.
platform/benchmark-results/.venv/
platform/benchmark-results/*.png
platform/benchmark-results/*.py
platform/benchmark-results/runs/**/*.canonical.json
platform/benchmark-results/runs/**/*.rich.json
